Firewall Map+ shows the firewall's live traffic on a world map, as a
dashboard widget and a full-size page. Flows are drawn from PF state counters
and geolocated locally (MaxMind GeoLite2 or DB-IP Lite); blocked connection
attempts come from the filter log. Traffic to or from addresses in threat
lists is flagged and recorded in a review queue, with on-demand registry,
routing and AbuseIPDB lookups.
